# Hook and action scripts run via their shebang (language: script) from
# pre-commit's own clone of this repo. On Windows with core.autocrlf=true
# that clone could otherwise get CRLF line endings, and a trailing \r on the
# shebang line breaks the script. Keep them LF on every platform.
*.py   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
